# Scratch for whatever Claude Design returns — EXCEPT the packet itself, which
# is the BINDING SPEC: §0 and its amendments are cited as authority by the
# components and by docs/, and a spec that lives only in somebody's scratch
# folder cannot be diffed, reviewed, or blamed when a screen and its drawing
# disagree. The contents are excluded rather than the folder, because git will
# not descend into an excluded directory and a re-include inside one never
# applies.
design-incoming/*
!design-incoming/design_handoff_kampus/

# Secrets. The ElevenLabs key for the voice pass lives in .env (docs/VOICE_PASS.md).
# Never commit it: a key in git history is leaked even after it is deleted.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
